25dd7\",\"revisionReason\":\"The previous judgment (49145a3e…) chose construction as the local repair of the defect that had been established by observation. That construction has now run (dae35a13…) and changed only generated/hello-world.mjs. The new worksite observation confirms the repaired bytes and unchanged protected assets.\\n\\nThe next step therefore moves from construction to re-testing, with the construction Result as the testing subject. The UAT dependency on the new testing evidence is kept.\\n\\nSeveral elements of the previous judgment carry over unchanged: the protected-asset boundary, the confined write roots, the local_repair disposition (now carried out, awaiting verification), and the unresolved support ref. The earlier failing testing Result is kept as first-attempt evidence but is no longer current for the candidate. One new judgment is added: command 2 passes only if the reported pass/fail counts show the tests actually ran, because the construction author reported the NODE_TEST_CONTEXT skip hazard.\",\"revisionEvidenceRefs\":[\"result://abiogenesis/49145a3e3676280c1cb37af26a273406950294a1fcea582228dbf5be45e33da1\",\"result://abiogenesis/dae35a130247e5f64abd488266967ee8b0d8be7d29c7e6ed0805c661b4f25dd7\",\"worksite-context-observation://abiogenesis/673530222b60c82a71b5c508935f47868f972a877f87f740a98476bcf317b9dc\",\"result://abiogenesis/648bb54aa05d48f3d8ca77031c0bd3e2a9636725af681fd005f7e38dbedcb8b2\"]}","structured_output":{"interpretation":"Executive frame applied to SCN-GLC-HELLO-WORLD-CLI-BASIC. The outcome needs two things: `node generated/hello-world.mjs` must write exactly \"Hello, world!\\n\" and exit 0, and `node --test` on the component and UAT tests must run the real CLI with at least 2 passes and 0 failures.\n\nThe previous judgment chose construction. That construction Result (dae35a13…) changed only generated/hello-world.mjs. The current worksite observation (673530…) confirms this. The file is now `console.log(\"Hello, world!\");\\n` (30 bytes, sha256:fe8f4080…). Every protected asset still has the digest declared in the original task: the original source, the oracle, the witness contract, the conformance and design documents, both test sources and test-execution-plan.json. So the local repair stayed inside its declared scope, and valid supplied work was kept.\n\nThe only admitted execution evidence is still testing Result 648bb54a…. It observed the old bytes: stdout 'Hello world!\\n', and `node --test` exited 1 with pass 0 and fail 2. That Result is kept as the first-attempt failure. It no longer describes the current candidate.\n\nThe construction author's own checks (direct stdout of 14 bytes, and 2 passes with 0 failures after unsetting NODE_TEST_CONTEXT) are self-reports. They are not admitted observations and not acceptance.\n\nThe candidate has therefore moved from \"established defect\" to \"repaired, not yet observed\". Priority: re-establish the steel thread on the repaired bytes. Current-boundary effect: the candidate cannot be accepted until there is fresh admitted execution evidence and an independent UAT verdict. support://default-library-witness/complete-source-outcome@5 remains unresolved.","contributions":[{"graphFunctionRef":"graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/testing@5","contribution":"Run the two declared commands again on the repaired generated/hello-world.mjs, from cwd '.', using the declared environment:\n1. `node generated/hello-world.mjs`\n2. `node --test test/component/hello-cli.test.mjs test/uat/hello-cli.uat.test.mjs`\n\nRecord the actual exit status, stdout, stderr and the reported tests/pass/fail counts, including any failure. Evidence may be written only under execution-evidence.\n\nThe subject is construction Result dae35a13…. Exit 0 alone is not enough. Command 2 counts as valid only if its stdout shows that the tests actually ran (tests ≥ 2, pass ≥ 2, fail 0). A run that skips the test files, for example because NODE_TEST_CONTEXT was inherited, must be recorded as not satisfying the plan.","reason":"The code under test has changed. Testing Result 648bb54a… applies only to the old bytes, so the affected thread must be observed again before any acceptance judgment. The construction author's local checks are self-reports, not admitted evidence. The author also warned that an inherited NODE_TEST_CONTEXT can make `node --test` exit 0 without running any tests. The previous harness environment was scrubbed (HOME, LANG, LC_ALL, PATH, TMPDIR only) and actually ran both tests, so this risk is low. Even so, the result must be judged on the reported pass/fail counts, not on the exit status alone.","supportRefs":["support://default-library-witness/complete-source-outcome@5"],"evidenceRefs":["task://default-library-witness/original@5","worksite-context-observation://abiogenesis/673530222b60c82a71b5c508935f47868f972a877f87f740a98476bcf317b9dc","result://abiogenesis/dae35a130247e5f64abd488266967ee8b0d8be7d29c7e6ed0805c661b4f25dd7","result://abiogenesis/648bb54aa05d48f3d8ca77031c0bd3e2a9636725af681fd005f7e38dbedcb8b2"],"dependsOn":["graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/construction@5"]},{"graphFunctionRef":"graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/uat@5","contribution":"Independently assess the full original outcome against source/basic-cli.oracle.json and the complete original source. The subject is the exact repaired candidate (sha256:fe8f4080…) together with the post-repair testing Result. The assessment should check:\n- direct CLI stdout is exactly 'Hello, world!\\n' with status 0;\n- both test bodies run the real CLI through spawnSync(process.execPath, ['generated/hello-world.mjs']);\n- `node --test` shows at least 2 passes and 0 failures;\n- the conformance, design, test-design and execution-plan documents are genuine;\n- whether the admitted execution observation supplies the test_execution_result meaning the oracle requires.\n\nRecord any criterion that is unmet or indeterminate as such.","reason":"The oracle requires an independent assessment of current admitted execution evidence. A report, file presence or stage count is not enough, and a completed testing child does not complete the application. UAT on the stale Result 648bb54a… could only confirm criteria that construction has since addressed. A meaningful verdict therefore depends on the new testing Result.","supportRefs":["support://default-library-witness/complete-source-outcome@5"],"evidenceRefs":["task://default-library-witness/original@5","worksite-context-observation://abiogenesis/673530222b60c82a71b5c508935f47868f972a877f87f740a98476bcf317b9dc","result://abiogenesis/dae35a130247e5f64abd488266967ee8b0d8be7d29c7e6ed0805c661b4f25dd7"],"dependsOn":["graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/construction@5","graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/testing@5"]}],"gaps":[],"nextGraphFunctionRef":"graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/testing@5","nextReason":"The local repair now exists on disk and stayed inside its declared scope. The current observation shows generated/hello-world.mjs with the comma, and all protected digests unchanged. However, no admitted observation of the repaired bytes exists yet. Running construction again would change nothing that has been shown to be defective. Running UAT now would only have the stale failing Result or the author's self-report to assess. Testing against construction Result dae35a13… is the step that turns the repair into current execution evidence, whether that evidence passes or fails.","nextEvidenceRefs":["task://default-library-witness/original@5","worksite-context-observation://abiogenesis/673530222b60c82a71b5c508935f47868f972a877f87f740a98476bcf317b9dc","result://abiogenesis/dae35a130247e5f64abd488266967ee8b0d8be7d29c7e6ed0805c661b4f25dd7","result://abiogenesis/648bb54aa05d48f3d8ca77031c0bd3e2a9636725af681fd005f7e38dbedcb8b2"],"subjectEvidenceRef":"result://abiogenesis/dae35a130247e5f64abd488266967ee8b0d8be7d29c7e6ed0805c661b4f25dd7","revisionReason":"The previous judgment (49145a3e…) chose construction as the local repair of the defect that had been established by observation. That construction has now run (dae35a13…) and changed only generated/hello-world.mjs. The new worksite observation confirms the repaired bytes and unchanged protected assets.\n\nThe next step therefore moves from construction to re-testing, with the construction Result as the testing subject. The UAT dependency on the new testing evidence is kept.\n\nSeveral elements of the previous judgment carry over unchanged: the protected-asset boundary, the confined write roots, the local_repair disposition (now carried out, awaiting verification), and the unresolved support ref. The earlier failing testing Result is kept as first-attempt evidence but is no longer current for the candidate. One new judgment is added: command 2 passes only if the reported pass/fail counts show the tests actually ran, because the construction author reported the NODE_TEST_CONTEXT skip hazard.","revisionEvidenceRefs":["result://abiogenesis/49145a3e3676280c1cb37af26a273406950294a1fcea582228dbf5be45e33da1","result://abiogenesis/dae35a130247e5f64abd488266967ee8b0d8be7d29c7e6ed0805c661b4f25dd7","worksite-context-observation://abiogenesis/673530222b60c82a71b5c508935f47868f972a877f87f740a98476bcf317b9dc","result://abiogenesis/648bb54aa05d48f3d8ca77031c0bd3e2a9636725af681fd005f7e38dbedcb8b2"]},"ttft_ms":16520,"type":"result","duration_ms":50943,"uuid":"e737035d-7c64-4066-ae66-9c5ac5ea3710","ttft_stream_ms":1988,"time_to_request_ms":503,"first_content_frame_ms":1989,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
